    },
    {
      "id": "uB2TCiSk9kl4wgxf9hA4e",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 4594.0487625176465,
      "y": -1220.511046875008,
      "width": 942.8719406818132,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "GjXEMKk6vMgi2YhLLmzsK",
      "index": "b1K00FzzzzzzzzzmG",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1186824969,
      "version": 1237,
      "versionNonce": 2010722121,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "x5ahlpMzG0mwlEf_9sYk2"
        },
        {
          "id": "_-TmFYVdyI39eMdDz9EoA",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1778724342948,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "x5ahlpMzG0mwlEf_9sYk2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4604.444937936678,
      "y": -1215.511046875008,
      "width": 922.07958984375,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "GjXEMKk6vMgi2YhLLmzsK",
      "index": "b1K00FzzzzzzzzzmV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 652805319,
      "version": 1578,
      "versionNonce": 350405865,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778724342948,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "我们的目标是去实现一个llm.c的c++版本，因此我们需要实现llm.c/llm.c下的24个.h文件\nllm.c/dev/cuda下的27个.cu文件\n我们只复刻基于tinyshakespear和open_web两个数据上的gpt2，这一部分的内容在llm.c/dev/data目录\n最后就是主文件train_gpt2.c\n其他相关的测试文件和调试文件需要即补充",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "uB2TCiSk9kl4wgxf9hA4e",
      "originalText": "我们的目标是去实现一个llm.c的c++版本，因此我们需要实现llm.c/llm.c下的24个.h文件\nllm.c/dev/cuda下的27个.cu文件\n我们只复刻基于tinyshakespear和open_web两个数据上的gpt2，这一部分的内容在llm.c/dev/data目录\n最后就是主文件train_gpt2.c\n其他相关的测试文件和调试文件需要即补充",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
