    {
      "id": "VeGmhB-AYCyo3j20dMBwF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11938.961381429504,
      "y": 1048.8356158916665,
      "width": 766.461137434784,
      "height": 216.90250666678355,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "_l9peLL2VqoWXFVbYjWYK"
      ],
      "frameId": "NNAssKWE4IoXSf2uqPzh-",
      "index": "b1KPl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1115968737,
      "version": 998,
      "versionNonce": 124934857,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779454304822,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "其中z_i为z的第i个分量，C为z的维数。通过\nSoftmax函数就可以将多分类的输出值转换为范\n围在[0, 1]和为1的概率分布。\n值得注意：实际处理中我们对认为z = x - max(x)\nmax 指x的最大分量，这主要是为了数值稳定。",
      "fontSize": 34.70440106668537,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "其中z_i为z的第i个分量，C为z的维数。通过Softmax函数就可以将多分类的输出值转换为范围在[0, 1]和为1的概率分布。\n值得注意：实际处理中我们对认为z = x - max(x)\nmax 指x的最大分量，这主要是为了数值稳定。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
